// 独立夹具中的真实自主交战。约束检查单独调用被占用的原版攻击；自然交战只观察、不代替人物选招。
using System;
using System.IO;
using System.Linq;
using System.Reflection;
using System.Collections;
using System.Collections.Generic;
using System.Threading.Tasks;
using Newtonsoft.Json;
using UnityEngine;
using DebugToolbox.Runtime.Scripting;
using Cultiway.Core;
using Cultiway.Core.Skills;
using Cultiway.Core.Combat.Tactical;
using Cultiway.Core.SkillLibV3.ActiveAbilities;
using Cultiway.Content.Skills;
using Cultiway.Content.Components;
using Cultiway.Content.Combat;
using Cultiway.Utils.Extension;
const BindingFlags F = BindingFlags.Public | BindingFlags.NonPublic | BindingFlags.Instance |
                       BindingFlags.Static;
string root = Cultiway.ModClass.I.GetDeclaration().FolderPath;
string folder = Path.Combine(root, "artifacts/skill_rebuild/autonomous-volley");
Directory.CreateDirectory(folder);
string stage = "setup";
var frameTimes = new List<double>();
Directory.CreateDirectory(Path.Combine(folder, "frames"));
var checks = new List<string>();

void Check(bool v, string n)
{
    if (!v) throw new InvalidOperationException(n);
    checks.Add(n);
    Log.Info(n);
}

var runnerType = typeof(AbilityCast).Assembly.GetType("Cultiway.Core.Performance.CooperativeSimulationRunner");
var runner = runnerType.GetProperty("Instance").GetValue(null);

async Task Boundary() =>
    await Game.WaitUntil(() => (bool)runnerType.GetProperty("IsAtCycleBoundary").GetValue(runner), 3600);

async Task Advance(float seconds)
{
    Config.paused = false;
    double until = World.world.getCurWorldTime() + seconds;
    if (stage != "body") await Game.WaitUntil(() => World.world.getCurWorldTime() >= until, 7200);
    else
    {
        double start = World.world.getCurWorldTime(), next = start;
        while (World.world.getCurWorldTime() < until)
        {
            await Game.NextFrame();
            double now = World.world.getCurWorldTime();
            if (now < next) continue;
            World.world.camera.transform.position =
                new Vector3(66.5f, 72.5f, World.world.camera.transform.position.z);
            MoveCamera.instance.forceZoom(10);
            new ScreenFacade().Capture(Path.Combine(folder, "frames",
                frameTimes.Count.ToString("00000") + ".png"));
            frameTimes.Add(now - start);
            next = now + .1;
        }
    }

    Config.paused = true;
    await Boundary();
}

Config.paused = true;
Game.Resume();
ControllableUnit.clear(false);
Config.setWorldSpeed("x1", false);
World.world.save_manager.loadWorld(Path.Combine(root, "Scripts/WorldSaveTests/Fixtures/world-format-1"));
await Game.WaitUntil(() => !SmoothLoader.isLoading(), 1800);
Config.paused = true;
await Boundary();
World.world.console.Hide();
foreach (var screen in Resources.FindObjectsOfTypeAll<LoadingScreen>()) screen.gameObject.SetActive(false);
var stats = new BaseStats();
stats.addTag("frozen_ai");
stats.addTag("immovable");
var hold = Cultiway.ModClass.L.StatusEffectLibrary.get("Cultiway.VolleyTargetHold") ?? Cultiway.Core.Libraries
    .StatusEffectAsset.StartBuild("Cultiway.VolleyTargetHold").SetStats(stats).SetDuration(10000).Build();
foreach (var a in World.world.units.getSimpleList().ToArray()) a.dieAndDestroy(AttackType.Other);
for (int y = 40; y < 105; y++)
for (int x = 40; x < 115; x++)
{
    var tile = World.world.GetTileSimple(x, y);
    if (tile.building != null) tile.building.removeBuildingFinal();
    tile.setTileTypes(TileLibrary.soil_low, TopTileLibrary.grass_low);
}

Actor actor = World.world.units.createNewUnit("human", World.world.GetTileSimple(66, 72), pAdultAge: true,
    pSpawnWithItems: false);
Actor enemy = World.world.units.createNewUnit("wolf", World.world.GetTileSimple(67, 72), pAdultAge: true,
    pSpawnWithItems: false);
actor.addTrait("super_health");
enemy.addTrait("super_health");
CombatStatusEffects.ApplyStatus(enemy, hold, 10000, enemy);
var owner = actor.GetExtend();
owner.AddComponent(new Xian { level = 2, wakan = 10000 });
actor.setStatsDirty();
actor.updateStats();
enemy.setStatsDirty();
enemy.updateStats();
actor.addAggro(enemy);
enemy.addAggro(actor);
actor.attack_target = enemy;
var spells = new List<string>();
string[] forms = { "sword", "hand", "branch", "water_wave", "water_whale", "fire_body" };
string[] matters = { "iron", "wood", "water", "water", "water", "fire" };
for (int i = 0; i < 24; i++)
{
    var d = new AbilityDefinition
    {
        Id = "test.volley." + i.ToString("D2"), Name = "轮换测试" + i, Cost = 1, Cooldown = .1f, Lifetime = 2.5f,
        Power = .001f, TargetRange = 40,
        Root = new ConstructionNode { Id = "root", Form = forms[i % 6], Matter = matters[i % 6], Scale = .7f }
    };
    ConstructedAbilityService.Register(d);
    ConstructedAbilityService.Learn(owner, d.Id);
    spells.Add(d.Id);
}

var bodies = new List<string>();
foreach (string name in new[] { "palm-strike", "sweeping-palm" })
{
    var d = JsonConvert.DeserializeObject<AbilityDefinition>(
        File.ReadAllText(Path.Combine(root, "Content/Skills/Body", name + ".json")));
    d = ConstructionMagnitudeEdits.Duration(d, 2.5f);
    d.Id = "test.volley.body." + name;
    d.Cost = 5;
    d.Resource = "wakan";
    d.Power = 2f;
    ConstructedAbilityService.Register(d);
    ConstructedAbilityService.Learn(owner, d.Id);
    bodies.Add(d.Id);
}

// 对真实收集结果检查高低两种候选上限；不施放、不占用、不修改费用或冷却。
var collectType =
    typeof(CombatWorldService).Assembly.GetType("Cultiway.Core.Combat.Tactical.CombatActionService");
var candidates = new List<CombatActionCandidate>();
collectType.GetMethod("Collect", F)
    .Invoke(null, new object[] { owner, enemy, null, 1f, new List<Actor>(), candidates });
var physical = candidates.First(c => c.Key.ProviderId == "core.physical");
var physicalLease = BodyControlState.TryAcquire(actor.id, BodyOccupancy.RightArm);
Check(physicalLease != null, "取得真实手臂占用作为原版攻击约束");
try
{
    actor.attack_timer = 0;
    var context =
        new CombatActionExecutionContext(owner, enemy, enemy, CombatActionUse.Offense, enemy.GetSimPos());
    Check(physical.Provider.TryExecute(physical, context) == CombatExecutionStatus.TemporarilyBlocked,
        "原版攻击不能穿过已占用手臂直接出手");
}
finally
{
    physicalLease.Dispose();
}

var limit = typeof(CombatWorldService).GetMethod("LimitActions", F);
var selection = new List<object>();
foreach (int cap in new[] { 8, 16 })
{
    int offset = 0;
    bool bounded = true;
    var seen = new HashSet<string>();
    for (int i = 0; i < 16; i++)
    {
        object[] args = { candidates, cap, offset };
        var chosen = (CombatActionCandidate[])limit.Invoke(null, args);
        offset = (int)args[2];
        bounded &= chosen.Length <= cap;
        foreach (var c in chosen) seen.Add(c.Key.EntryId);
    }

    Check(bounded, "每轮候选都遵守上限" + cap);
    Check(spells.All(seen.Contains), "上限" + cap + "仍能轮到全部24种可用构造");
    selection.Add(new { cap, count = seen.Count });
}

stage = "recovery";
int maxConcurrent = 0;
var events = new List<object>();
var starts = new List<ConstructedCastStarted>();
var contacts = new List<ConstructedContact>();
bool pureDuringRecovery = false, pureDuringBody = false, bodyOverlap = false;
double previousBodyEnd = -1;

void Started(ConstructedCastStarted c)
{
    if (c.SourceId != actor.id) return;
    starts.Add(c);
    bool body = bodies.Contains(c.AbilityId);
    if (body)
    {
        if (c.WorldTime < previousBodyEnd - .0001) bodyOverlap = true;
        previousBodyEnd = c.WorldTime + ConstructionEditing.Access.Read(c.AbilityId).Lifetime;
    }
    else
    {
        pureDuringRecovery |= actor.attack_timer > 0;
        pureDuringBody |= c.WorldTime < previousBodyEnd &&
                          BodyControlState.IsBusy(actor.id, BodyOccupancy.RightArm);
    }

    int live = ((IEnumerable)typeof(ConstructedAbilityService).GetField("casts", F).GetValue(null))
        .Cast<object>().Count(v => (long)v.GetType().GetField("SourceId", F).GetValue(v) == actor.id);
    maxConcurrent = Math.Max(maxConcurrent, live);
    events.Add(new
    {
        stage, c.CastId, c.AbilityId, c.WorldTime, origin = c.Origin.ToString(), body,
        attackTimer = actor.attack_timer, wakan = owner.GetComponent<Xian>().wakan, live
    });
}

void Contact(ConstructedContact c)
{
    if (c.SourceId == actor.id) contacts.Add(c);
}

ConstructedAbilityService.CastStarted += Started;
ConstructedAbilityService.ContactConfirmed += Contact;
try
{
    actor.attack_timer = 100;
    await Advance(12);
    File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(folder, "partial.json"),
        JsonConvert.SerializeObject(
            new
            {
                stage, checks, events, actor = actor.id, enemy = enemy.id, maxConcurrent,
                contacts = contacts.Count
            }, Formatting.Indented));
    Check(starts.Count >= 24 && spells.All(id => starts.Any(c => c.AbilityId == id)), "真实自主交战轮到全部24种法术");
    Check(starts.All(c => c.Origin == ActiveAbilityUseOrigin.Autonomous), "所有实际施放均来自自主入口");
    Check(pureDuringRecovery, "真实普攻恢复期间仍可启动独立法术");
    Check(maxConcurrent >= 6, "至少六个独立施放真实共存");
    Check(contacts.Count > 0, "并存构造实际接触敌人，非仅增加显示对象");

    int Revision()
    {
        var all = (IDictionary)typeof(CombatWorldService).GetField("ActorStates", F).GetValue(null);
        var r = all[actor.id];
        return (int)r.GetType().GetField("Revision", F).GetValue(r);
    }

    int beforeBodyRevision = Revision();
    stage = "body";
    var noWalkStats = new BaseStats { ["multiplier_speed"] = -1f };
    var noWalk = Cultiway.ModClass.L.StatusEffectLibrary.get("Cultiway.VolleyNoWalk") ?? Cultiway.Core.Libraries
        .StatusEffectAsset.StartBuild("Cultiway.VolleyNoWalk").SetStats(noWalkStats).SetDuration(10000).Build();
    CombatStatusEffects.ApplyStatus(actor, noWalk, 10000, actor);
    actor.stopMovement();
    actor.current_position = enemy.current_position + Vector2.left * .45f;
    actor.setCurrentTile(
        World.world.GetTileSimple((int)actor.current_position.x, (int)actor.current_position.y));
    actor.updatePos();
    actor.setStatsDirty();
    actor.updateStats();
    foreach (string id in spells.Take(3))
    {
        var close = ConstructionEditing.Access.Read(id);
        close.TargetRange = 1;
        ConstructedAbilityService.Register(close);
    }

    owner.AddComponent(new ConstructedKnowledge
        { Ids = new[] { bodies[0], bodies[1], spells[0], spells[1], spells[2] } });
    actor.attack_timer = 0;
    stage = "body-wait";
    var waitingLease = BodyControlState.TryAcquire(actor.id, BodyOccupancy.RightArm);
    try
    {
        await Advance(2.8f);
    }
    finally
    {
        waitingLease?.Dispose();
    }

    stage = "body";
    actor.stopMovement();
    actor.current_position = enemy.current_position + Vector2.left * .35f;
    actor.setCurrentTile(
        World.world.GetTileSimple((int)actor.current_position.x, (int)actor.current_position.y));
    actor.updatePos();
    actor.attack_timer = 0;
    await Advance(8);
    Check(Revision() > beforeBodyRevision, "正在攻击与移动的交战者仍持续更新计划");
    Check(starts.Any(c => bodies.Contains(c.AbilityId)), "真实选招启动已学身体动作");
    Check(!bodyOverlap, "冲突身体动作没有同时占用同一部位");
    Check(pureDuringBody, "身体动作期间仍可启动不占身体的法术");
    Check(contacts.Any(c => bodies.Contains(c.AbilityId)), "自主身体动作也产生真实接触");
    stage = "budget";
    owner.AddComponent(new ConstructedKnowledge { Ids = spells.ToArray() });
    await Advance(3);
    int before = starts.Count;
    owner.GetComponent<Xian>().wakan = 2.5f;
    await Advance(.75f);
    int lowCount = starts.Count - before;
    Check(lowCount <= 2 && owner.GetComponent<Xian>().wakan >= 0, "同轮逐项支付，余量不够第三术时停止且不透支");
    Check(lowCount > 0, "有限资源仍允许付得起的法术真实启动");
    stage = "cooldown";
    int cooldownStart = starts.Count;
    owner.AddComponent(new ConstructedKnowledge { Ids = new[] { spells[0] } });
    owner.GetComponent<Xian>().wakan = 100;
    var longCooldown = ConstructionEditing.Access.Read(spells[0]);
    longCooldown.Cooldown = 3;
    longCooldown.TargetRange = 40;
    ConstructedAbilityService.Register(longCooldown);
    await Advance(7);
    var recent = starts.Skip(cooldownStart).Where(c => c.AbilityId == spells[0]).Select(c => c.WorldTime)
        .ToArray();
    Check(recent.Length >= 2 && recent.Zip(recent.Skip(1), (a, b) => b - a).All(g => g >= 2.99),
        "独立冷却限制真正重复出手");
    stage = "no-enemy";
    enemy.dieSimpleNone();
    int after = starts.Count;
    await Advance(2);
    Check(starts.Count == after, "敌人死亡后不继续朝旧目标施放");
    var result = new
    {
        passed = true, checks, selection, total = starts.Count, knownSpells = spells.Count,
        distinct = starts.Select(c => c.AbilityId).Distinct().Count(), maxConcurrent, pureDuringRecovery,
        pureDuringBody, bodyOverlap, contacts = contacts.Count, frameTimes, events
    };
    File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(folder, "result.json"),
        JsonConvert.SerializeObject(result, Formatting.Indented));
    return result;
}
finally
{
    File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(folder, "partial.json"),
        JsonConvert.SerializeObject(
            new
            {
                stage, checks, events, actor = actor.id, enemy = enemy.id, maxConcurrent,
                contacts = contacts.Count
            }, Formatting.Indented));
    ConstructedAbilityService.CastStarted -= Started;
    ConstructedAbilityService.ContactConfirmed -= Contact;
    Config.paused = true;
}
